RE ACCESSIBLE TO WOMEN.'}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2022-02-02 09:00:00', 'title': "BORGWARNER JOINS DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY'S BETTER CLIMATE CHALLENGE AIMED AT SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCING GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS", 'text': "AUBURN HILLS, MICH., FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BORGWARNER INC., (BORGWARNER) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS JOINED THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY'S (DOE) BETTER CLIMATE CHALLENGE, A NATIONAL LEADERSHIP INITIATIVE THAT CALLS ON CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICERS, UNIVERSITY PRESIDENTS AND STATE AND LOCAL LEADERS TO REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS, CREATE JOBS, AND PROMOTE HEALTHY, SAFE AND THRIVING COMMUNITIES."}{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2022-02-02 06:30:00', 'title': 'BOSTON SCIENTIFIC ANNOUNCES RESULTS FOR FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021', 'text': 'MARLBOROUGH, MASS., FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: BSX) GENERATED NET SALES OF $3.127 BILLION DURING THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021, GROWING 15.4 PERCENT ON A REPORTED BASIS, 16.9 PERCENT ON AN OPERATIONAL1 BASIS AND 15.1 PERCENT ON AN ORGANIC2 BASIS, ALL COMPARED TO THE PRIOR YEAR PERIOD.'}{'symbol': 'CHRW', 'date': '2022-02-02 07:30:00', 'title': 'C.H. ROBINSON REPORTS 2021 FOURTH QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'EDEN PRAIRIE, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CHROBINSON--C.H. ROBINSON REPORTS 2021 FOURTH QUARTER RESULTS'}{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-02-02 14:57:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT HOSTS ONE DAY WITH THOUSANDS OF POSSIBILITIES AT NATIONAL DAY OF HIRING EVENT FEB. 24', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, THE LARGEST CASINO-ENTERTAINMENT COMPANY\xa0IN THE U.S., IS HOSTING A NATIONAL DAY OF HIRING EVENT ON FEB. 24 WHERE POTENTIAL TEAM MEMBERS CAN LEARN MORE ABOUT THE CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT PORTFOLIO AND POSSIBILITIES WITHIN THE COMPANY. ONE DAY WITH THOUSANDS OF POSSIBILITIES, CAESARS HOPES TO SHARE THE WIDE SPAN OF ROLES FOR INDIVIDUALS TO PURSUE WITHIN THE CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT EMPIRE.'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2022-02-02 09:00:0